---
Fast CLI for Apple Notes, Reminders, and Calendar

Usage: nib [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  doctor  Check system access and configuration without prompting
  config  Inspect and edit configuration
  today   Show today's reminders and events
  note    Create and list notes
  task    Add and list reminders [alias: todo]
  cal     Show calendar events [alias: c]
  n       Create a note from the rest of the line, or list notes
  t       Add a reminder from the rest of the line, or list reminders
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json     Print JSON instead of text
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
